category: Libs
requires: cygwin libredwg0 python312
sdesc: "Free C library to read and write DWG files (python312 bindings)"
ldesc: "GNU LibreDWG is a free C library to handle DWG files. It aims to be a free
replacement for the OpenDWG libraries. DWG is the native file format of
AutoCAD."
external-source: libredwg

